Scope note

This MIT-0 license covers the `dsh-owlrunkit` package: the Cordis provider in
`lib/`, the bundle patch, locales, icon, documentation, and the bundled skill
copy under `assets/`.

The bundled skill under `assets/` is the OwlCoda RunKit skill package and keeps
its own `assets/LICENSE` (also MIT-0). It contains instructions,
documentation, and JSON templates only.

The `owlrunkit` command-line tool that the skill invokes is a separate and
independent work, distributed under GPL-3.0-or-later. Neither this package nor
the bundled skill contains any portion of that tool's source code; the skill
invokes it only as an external process over the command line.

The GPL-3.0-or-later license at the root of the repository that hosts this
directory governs the repository as a whole and does not override the MIT-0
grant above for this directory.
